                                "sense_id": "f1a89671-7f39-3b72-aeaf-ffba871006c0",
                                "text": "The sun-flakes by multitudes lie, / Shed loose as the petals of roses discrowned / On the floors of the forest engilt and embrowned / And reddened afar and anigh."
